Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 17:15:00 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] dt-bindings: mailbox: select certified AOP reload through DT

A retained AOP must not be reset as though it were a fresh boot.
Describe the compatible and retained-reload property.

Assisted-by: LLM
---
 .../devicetree/bindings/mailbox/apple,mailbox.yaml          | 6 ++++++
 1 file changed, 6 insertions(+)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/mailbox/apple,mailbox.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/mailbox/apple,mailbox.yaml
index ba035ff80..8821623d3 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/mailbox/apple,mailbox.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/mailbox/apple,mailbox.yaml
@@ -22,6 +22,12 @@ description:
 properties:
   compatible:
     oneOf:
+      - description:
+          The same A7 IOP mailbox on the A9.
+        items:
+          - const: apple,s8000-a7iop-mailbox
+          - const: apple,t8010-a7iop-mailbox
+
       - description:
           ASC mailboxes are the most common variant found on the M1 used
           for example for the display controller, the system management
